" end="01:25.030">Beat </span><span begin="01:25.030" end="01:27.220">poetry</span><span begin="01:27.220" end="01:27.880">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.880" end="01:32.020"><span begin="01:27.880" end="01:27.970">And </span><span begin="01:27.970" end="01:28.270">my </span><span begin="01:28.270" end="01:28.930">jazz </span><span begin="01:28.930" end="01:30.340">collection's </span><span begin="01:30.340" end="01:32.020">rare</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.050" end="01:36.640"><span begin="01:32.050" end="01:32.350">I </span><span begin="01:32.350" end="01:32.680">can </span><span begin="01:32.680" end="01:33.220">play </span><span begin="01:33.220" end="01:33.940">most </span><span begin="01:33.940" end="01:36.580">anything</span><span begin="01:36.580" end="01:36.640">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.640" end="01:41.080"><span begin="01:36.640" end="01:36.970">I'm </span><span begin="01:36.970" end="01:37.210">a </span><span begin="01:37.210" end="01:38.260">Brooklyn </span><span begin="01:38.260" end="01:40.990">baby</span><span begin="01:40.990" end="01:41.080">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.080" end="01:44.920"><span begin="01:41.080" end="01:41.350">I'm </span><span begin="01:41.350" end="01:41.590">a </span><span begin="01:41.590" end="01:42.670">Brooklyn </span><span begin="01:42.670" end="01:44.920">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.660" end="02:00.010"><span begin="01:55.660" end="01:55.840">They </span><span begin="01:55.840" end="01:56.290">say </span><span begin="01:56.290" end="01:56.500">I'm </span><span begin="01:56.500" end="01:57.010">too </span><span begin="01:57.010" end="01:57.640">young </span><span begin="01:57.640" end="01:57.880">to </span><span begin="01:57.880" end="01:58.450">love </span><span begin="01:58.450" end="01:59.740">you</span><span begin="01:59.740" end="02:00.010">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.010" end="02:04.450"><span begin="02:00.010" end="02:00.160">Th